Process shipping amount and payment fee correctly in wallee refund (IPET-1184, IPET-1206, IPET-1269), updated for wallee/magento-2 3.5.3.
LineItemReductionService::convertShipping() subtracts the shipping discount tax compensation before comparing with the order shipping amount, otherwise a full shipping refund is never recognised.
Webhook SuccessfulCommand does not pass a partial shipping refund (unit price reduction, recognised by the remaining quantity and amount of the shipping line in the reduced line items) as creditmemo shipping amount, so reconcileCreditmemoTotal() books it as an adjustment, and adds the full shipping discount instead of its proportional share when a shipping amount is refunded.
reconcileCreditmemoTotal() aligns the creditmemo with the open order total instead of the refund amount when the refund amount from wallee is 0.01 below it, so a full refund closes the order.

